<BaseLayout title="DataForSEO Review: API Coverage & Test Boundaries (2026)" description="Evidence-led DataForSEO review covering documented SERP, keyword and AI-search APIs and the limits of our current hands-on evidence.">
<section class="prose"><p class="eyebrow">Evidence review · Updated Sep 23, 2026</p><h1>DataForSEO review: what is documented, and what we have not tested yet</h1>
<div class="notice"><strong>Evidence boundary:</strong> Search Data Bench has not completed its frozen live Benchmark #1 workload against DataForSEO. Performance, latency, completeness and comparable workload cost remain NOT TESTED here.</div>
<p>DataForSEO documents a broad API surface spanning conventional search data and newer AI-search datasets. Its official documentation covers SERP APIs, keyword-data APIs and a separate AI Optimization family.</p>
<h2>Documented API surface</h2><p>The provider documents organic SERP endpoints and keyword-data endpoints. Its AI Optimization documentation includes LLM response/scraping functions, AI keyword data and LLM mentions. Google AI Mode SERP endpoints are also documented.</p>
<h2>What this review does not claim</h2><p>We are not treating provider documentation as hands-on performance evidence. We have not measured DataForSEO against the SDB-B01 fixed workload, so we do not claim that it is faster, more complete, more accurate or cheaper than SE Ranking, Mangools or SerpApi.</p>
<h2>Evidence status</h2><table><tbody><tr><th>SERP API availability</th><td>OFFICIAL DOCUMENTED</td></tr><tr><th>Keyword-data API availability</th><td>OFFICIAL DOCUMENTED</td></tr><tr><th>AI Optimization APIs</th><td>OFFICIAL DOCUMENTED</td></tr><tr><th>Search Data Bench live performance</th><td>NOT TESTED</td></tr><tr><th>Comparable SDB-B01 cost</th><td>UNRESOLVED</td></tr></tbody></table>
<h2>Commercial disclosure</h2><p>Search Data Bench participates in the DataForSEO affiliate program. That relationship does not change the evidence status above.</p><p><TrackedLink href="https://try.dataforseo.com/3zzt96c0svoj" label="Visit DataForSEO" affiliate={true} eventId="affiliate-dataforseo-review" /></p>
